"""Interactive unified inbox for Himalaya 2.1, with private local drafts.

CLI and envelope format:
https://github.com/pimalaya/himalaya/tree/v2.1.0
See `himalaya envelope list --help` and its generated JSON schema.
Terminal API: https://docs.python.org/3/library/curses.html
Reply identifiers: https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5322#section-3.6.4
"""

